    - Name: name
      Entry: 1
      Data: The Sightsunder
    - Name: lore
      Entry: 1
      Data: "While warriors clash in the brutal chaos of the frontlines, elite archers
        stand behind them\u2014imbuing their bows with arcane power. With the legendary
        Sightsunder in hand, they fire arrows that tear through the wind, striking
        true into the hearts of their enemies."
