      Data: Dark.Scripts.Common.Lore.LoreInfo, Assembly-CSharp
    - Name: name
      Entry: 1
      Data: The Vergebrand
    - Name: lore
      Entry: 1
      Data: "While arrows fall and battle rages in thunderous waves, The Vergebrand
        strides into the heart of the fray \u2014 a knight wreathed in steel and
        oathbound flame. With a sacred blade in hand, they cleave through shadow
        and siege alike, each strike blazing with the will to defend the towers."
