      Data: Dark.Scripts.Common.Lore.LoreInfo, Assembly-CSharp
    - Name: name
      Entry: 1
      Data: The Verge
    - Name: lore
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The Verge is the ruined frontier between humanity and The Nullnest,
        where ancient Towers seal the Gates to the mortal world. In the abyss beyond,
        the relentless Redgaze wait \u2014 for only by destroying a Tower can they
        break through. Barren and lifeless, The Verge is nothing but an endless battlefield
        of ash and war."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
