      Entry: 7
      Data: Dark.Scripts.Common.Lore.LoreInfo, Assembly-CSharp
    - Name: name
      Entry: 1
      Data: Redgaze
    - Name: lore
      Entry: 1
      Data: "The Redgaze were once human, who forged The Nullnest through forbidden
        magic to escape a dying world. Twisted by the ritual \u2014 eyes crimson,
        flesh darkened \u2014 they were cast out and sealed away. In exile, their
        hatred grew, and so began the war that would rage until a hero created The
        Verge to end it."
    - Name: 
      Entry: 8
