      Entry: 7
      Data: Dark.Scripts.Common.Lore.LoreInfo, Assembly-CSharp
    - Name: name
      Entry: 1
      Data: The Towers
    - Name: lore
      Entry: 1
      Data: "They were once fractures in reality \u2014 wounds through which the
        Redgaze could enter the mortal world. None remember who raised the three
        great Towers to seal those rifts. Yet the Towers bind more than the abyss
        \u2014 they also imprison their chosen guardian, chaining him to an unyielding
        fate: to defend them for eternity."
