      Data: Dark.Scripts.Common.Lore.LoreInfo, Assembly-CSharp
    - Name: name
      Entry: 1
      Data: Vestige
    - Name: lore
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Vestige is what remains when the magic of the Redgaze\u2014or of Ash
        Warden himself\u2014strips away the life-force, strength, and essence of
        a being or object."
