    - Name: name
      Entry: 1
      Data: Sigils
    - Name: lore
      Entry: 1
      Data: "Sigils are formed by the primordial Redgaze\u2014those who first wielded
        the soul-stealing magic and were cast into Nullnest for being too dangerous."
